<title>UK: UK M0 grows provisional 6.3 pct in year to June.</title>
<headline>UK M0 grows provisional 6.3 pct in year to June.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England released the following provisional data on M0 money supply -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY (in pct)	   JUNE		 MAY</p>
<p>    M0 in month (adjusted)	   1.0		+0.5</p>
<p>    M0 annual (adjusted)	     6.3		+6.1</p>
<p>    M0 in month (unadjusted)	 0.6		+1.2</p>
<p>    M0 annual (unadjusted)	   6.3		+6.1</p>
<p>NOTE - consensus forecast 6.0 pct yr/yr s/adj growth.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
